WEBVTT

00:01:37.580 --> 00:01:39.290
Gimme a sec.

00:01:39.290 --> 00:01:40.660
Hurry up!

00:01:40.660 --> 00:01:42.210
I can't do it!

00:01:42.210 --> 00:01:45.210
Ugh, it's creepy.

00:01:45.210 --> 00:01:47.290
Let's see.

00:01:47.290 --> 00:01:48.380
What is it?

00:01:48.380 --> 00:01:49.760
A <i>kaiju</i>?

00:01:51.130 --> 00:01:53.010
A failed <i>kaiju</i>.

00:02:04.600 --> 00:02:06.110
What the--?!

00:02:10.230 --> 00:02:12.280
Damn cat.

00:02:12.280 --> 00:02:15.780
What a gross face!

00:02:15.780 --> 00:02:18.700
Man, talk about rude.

00:02:18.700 --> 00:02:21.330
Is my face really that ugly?

00:02:23.910 --> 00:02:25.790
Hey!

00:02:25.040 --> 00:02:29.040
What Is This Wavering Emotion?

00:02:25.040 --> 00:02:29.040
Episode 8

00:02:25.790 --> 00:02:27.960
The hell is this?!

00:02:30.130 --> 00:02:31.420
What's up?

00:02:31.420 --> 00:02:35.340
I guess they came to talk with Futaba.

00:02:35.340 --> 00:02:36.800
Futaba?

00:02:36.800 --> 00:02:41.180
That's right. He quit
a while back, though.

00:02:42.640 --> 00:02:45.640
Um, do you have his contact info?

00:02:45.640 --> 00:02:50.440
Of course we do,
but that's private information.

00:02:50.440 --> 00:02:52.110
Oh, yeah.

00:03:01.950 --> 00:03:04.750
Inamoto, what is this?

00:03:04.750 --> 00:03:09.960
I found it here. We could
do anything with this much.

00:03:09.960 --> 00:03:11.420
It's real?

00:03:12.460 --> 00:03:15.470
Let's go somewhere together.

00:03:18.470 --> 00:03:20.010
Somewhere?

00:03:24.430 --> 00:03:27.520
I wonder why I got married?

00:03:27.520 --> 00:03:32.320
It helped us realize
we should value each other more.

00:03:43.450 --> 00:03:43.530
{=1}Chise

00:03:43.450 --> 00:03:43.490
{=0}Calling

00:03:43.490 --> 00:03:43.530
