00:03:45.370 --> 00:03:46.210
Hello?

00:03:46.210 --> 00:03:51.670
Senpai? Where are you?
Gauma called an emergency meeting.

00:03:51.670 --> 00:03:53.170
Be right there.

00:03:58.470 --> 00:04:02.600
I'm sure Futaba will call eventually.

00:04:02.600 --> 00:04:04.600
I hope so.

00:04:06.890 --> 00:04:09.850
You wanna go somewhere?

00:04:09.850 --> 00:04:11.190
Where?

00:04:11.190 --> 00:04:14.980
Uh, well... Anywhere is fine.

00:04:17.440 --> 00:04:19.240
Um...

00:04:30.870 --> 00:04:32.330
What's this face?

00:04:34.130 --> 00:04:36.130
Another <i>kaiju</i>?

00:04:36.130 --> 00:04:38.970
Yeah. A <i>kaiju </i>got me.

00:04:38.970 --> 00:04:44.810
Only a <i>kaiju </i>could do this!
Everyone, let's split up and find it!

00:04:44.810 --> 00:04:46.350
Find it?

00:04:46.350 --> 00:04:50.100
It's using power but hasn't shown itself.

00:04:50.100 --> 00:04:51.400
True.

00:04:51.400 --> 00:04:54.310
It could be a little <i>kaiju</i>.

00:04:54.310 --> 00:04:56.820
I guess there's all types of <i>kaiju</i>.

00:04:56.820 --> 00:05:02.360
It still might be nearby.
If we all look, we'll find it quick.

00:05:02.360 --> 00:05:06.290
Don't let your guard down
or you'll become like me.

00:05:06.290 --> 00:05:08.200
That would suck.

00:05:14.040 --> 00:05:20.380
Is Gauma seriously saying there's
a <i>kaiju </i>that goes around coloring stuff?

00:05:20.380 --> 00:05:21.260
There's one.

00:05:21.260 --> 00:05:22.220
Huh?

00:05:23.760 --> 00:05:25.390
There <i>is </i>one!

00:05:25.390 --> 00:05:28.220
It's really small.

00:05:28.220 --> 00:05:29.680
It's running!

00:05:29.680 --> 00:05:32.140
Tell Gauma! I'll catch it!

00:05:32.140 --> 00:05:33.150
Right!

00:05:36.650 --> 00:05:40.240
No matter how small it is,
it's still a <i>kaiju</i>.

00:05:43.160 --> 00:05:44.240
Huh?

00:05:47.120 --> 00:05:48.790
What's his deal?

00:05:48.790 --> 00:05:49.910
Catch it?

00:05:49.910 --> 00:05:51.710
It fell on its own.

00:05:53.000 --> 00:05:55.880
Look how cute it-- Never mind.

00:06:01.380 --> 00:06:05.300
Good job, Yomogi! Now I'll defeat it!

00:06:05.300 --> 00:06:08.430
Defeat it? You're gonna kill it?

00:06:08.430 --> 00:06:10.140
Don't we always?

00:06:10.140 --> 00:06:12.480
Yeah, I guess so.

00:06:12.480 --> 00:06:15.770
All right... Here goes.

00:06:17.860 --> 00:06:18.820
W-Wait!

00:06:18.820 --> 00:06:20.230
What now?!

00:06:20.230 --> 00:06:25.200
Don't <i>kaiju </i>wreck things
'cuz the Eugenicists control them?

00:06:25.200 --> 00:06:26.200
Yeah.

00:06:26.200 --> 00:06:29.280
But you'll kill it when they're not?

00:06:29.280 --> 00:06:30.120
Mmm?

00:06:30.120 --> 00:06:32.870
Yeah, it's not hurting anything.

00:06:32.870 --> 00:06:34.790
It's just coloring stuff.

00:06:34.790 --> 00:06:38.290
Don't you think killing it sounds cruel?

00:06:39.250 --> 00:06:43.010
Good point. Maybe you're right.

00:06:43.010 --> 00:06:47.640
In that case, I'll control it
as a <i>kaiju </i>user.

00:06:47.640 --> 00:06:50.680
Oh, yeah. Gauma's a <i>kaiju </i>user.

00:06:50.680 --> 00:06:54.270
I've never seen him do it though.

00:06:54.270 --> 00:06:56.900
Well, watch closely!

00:06:56.900 --> 00:07:00.070
Instance Domination!

00:07:05.360 --> 00:07:08.820
Are you controlling it right now?

00:07:11.490 --> 00:07:15.790
It's no use. My power must've weakened.

00:07:15.790 --> 00:07:19.130
Instance Domination!

00:07:16.950 --> 00:07:17.540
Huh?

00:07:19.960 --> 00:07:21.670
You making fun?!

00:07:21.670 --> 00:07:25.050
Nah, but I thought I'd give it a shot!

00:07:25.050 --> 00:07:28.300
That's not how <i>kaiju </i>users work!

00:07:28.300 --> 00:07:32.100
You've gotta train and train your ass off.

00:07:32.100 --> 00:07:33.520
Instance Domination.

00:07:33.520 --> 00:07:35.310
You didn't train shit!

00:07:35.310 --> 00:07:38.190
Go on. Let's see your training.

00:07:38.190 --> 00:07:40.270
You <i>are </i>making fun.

00:07:40.270 --> 00:07:42.150
I think I'll pass.

00:07:42.150 --> 00:07:44.490
Instance Domination.

00:07:42.900 --> 00:07:43.400
Huh?

00:07:47.360 --> 00:07:49.280
Eh?

00:07:54.450 --> 00:07:56.870
Instance Domination.

00:07:58.870 --> 00:08:00.460
Huh? Sweet!

00:08:00.460 --> 00:08:01.290
Whoa!

00:08:01.290 --> 00:08:04.510
Yomogi! Holy shit!

00:08:04.510 --> 00:08:05.420
You did it.

00:08:05.420 --> 00:08:07.380
You're kidding me!

00:08:15.180 --> 00:08:17.390
You tricked us.

00:08:17.390 --> 00:08:19.060
That was freaky.

00:08:22.480 --> 00:08:23.820
What's wrong?

00:08:23.820 --> 00:08:26.530
Nothing, but...

00:08:26.530 --> 00:08:29.860
So, Captain? What to do with the <i>kaiju</i>?

00:08:29.860 --> 00:08:34.620
Yeah, uh... I'll take it home
and keep an eye on it.

00:08:34.620 --> 00:08:36.080
You'll keep it?

00:08:36.080 --> 00:08:39.080
To see if it'll fix my face somehow.

00:08:39.080 --> 00:08:43.210
But if it causes any damage, I'll kill it.

00:08:43.210 --> 00:08:46.380
Until then, you'll look like that?

00:08:46.380 --> 00:08:49.050
I might just kill it sooner.

00:08:49.050 --> 00:08:52.090
Well, look who we have here!

00:08:54.180 --> 00:08:56.350
You guys are still here?

00:08:56.350 --> 00:08:59.310
Why should we have left?

00:08:59.310 --> 00:09:02.520
Is that a <i>kaiju </i>I see?

00:09:02.520 --> 00:09:06.360
It's rare for Sizumu
to invite us somewhere.

00:09:06.360 --> 00:09:11.740
All we can do is wait for a <i>kaiju</i>,
so why not have fun?

00:09:11.740 --> 00:09:16.370
Hey, hey, hey, hey! This looks fun!

00:09:17.240 --> 00:09:21.960
Worried about <i>kaiju </i>being born
while we're in there?

00:09:21.960 --> 00:09:24.630
Learn to loosen up!

00:09:24.630 --> 00:09:27.090
Did you two always get along?

00:09:27.090 --> 00:09:28.630
No way.

00:09:30.670 --> 00:09:34.050
It's believed that <i>kaiju </i>have a source.

00:09:34.050 --> 00:09:35.640
A source?

00:09:35.640 --> 00:09:40.100
However, for <i>kaiju </i>to
appear this frequently,

00:09:40.100 --> 00:09:44.940
their sources must be
purposely scattered around.

00:09:44.940 --> 00:09:47.400
The Kaiju Eugenicists?

00:09:47.400 --> 00:09:48.610
Mmm.

00:09:48.610 --> 00:09:51.610
The human heart feeds the source.

00:09:51.610 --> 00:09:55.870
Emotions give birth to and nurture <i>kaiju</i>.

00:09:57.240 --> 00:10:02.750
How do you guys know that?
It's not like you're <i>kaiju</i>.

00:10:07.590 --> 00:10:11.840
So a <i>kaiju </i>user like you
didn't know, Captain Gauma?

00:10:11.840 --> 00:10:18.140
It's news to me. <i>Kaiju </i>users
don't need to know how <i>kaiju </i>are born.

00:10:18.140 --> 00:10:20.970
This <i>kaiju </i>may be incomplete

00:10:20.970 --> 00:10:25.400
because the human
responsible for it is, too.

00:10:25.400 --> 00:10:29.940
Even so, it'll be dangerous if it grows.

00:10:29.940 --> 00:10:31.780
You think?

00:10:31.780 --> 00:10:35.240
I'm saying we can't leave it be.

00:10:35.240 --> 00:10:38.120
That's why I'm watching it.

00:10:38.120 --> 00:10:41.580
Won't it absorb emotions or something?

00:10:41.580 --> 00:10:44.460
You mean, like mine?

00:10:44.460 --> 00:10:47.420
Whatever. Just watch it closely.

00:10:47.420 --> 00:10:50.130
I already said I would.

00:10:50.130 --> 00:10:53.170
They grow through human emotions...

00:10:53.170 --> 00:10:53.920
What?

00:10:53.920 --> 00:10:55.630
Oh, nothing.

00:11:04.730 --> 00:11:06.020
What?!

00:11:06.940 --> 00:11:11.690
Oh, shit! Stop pushing me, idiot!

00:11:06.940 --> 00:11:11.690
Wait, wait up! Hey!

00:11:15.860 --> 00:11:18.200
Is it okay to be doing this?

00:11:21.990 --> 00:11:26.920
At least you behave,
but you're really an eyesore.

00:11:28.920 --> 00:11:33.300
That person was kind to living things...

00:11:34.720 --> 00:11:37.550
Where are you, Princess?

00:11:38.680 --> 00:11:44.140
In this world, there're three things
important for people to keep:

00:11:44.140 --> 00:11:47.600
Promises, love, and...

00:11:51.360 --> 00:11:53.150
It's already this late?

00:11:53.150 --> 00:11:55.030
Sleepy!

00:12:00.700 --> 00:12:02.870
Hey, hey, hey!

00:12:04.120 --> 00:12:08.710
Before anyone asks,
I swear I was watching it!

00:12:08.710 --> 00:12:12.290
But in an instant--
the instant I looked away...!

00:12:12.290 --> 00:12:15.460
Gauma, that's three times.

00:12:15.460 --> 00:12:21.100
Excuses aside, Captain,
what should we do now?

00:12:21.100 --> 00:12:24.850
Let's split up and look for the <i>kaiju</i>!

00:12:25.930 --> 00:12:27.940
It's Sunday, you know.

00:12:27.940 --> 00:12:29.850
S-Sorry.

00:12:29.850 --> 00:12:31.400
Whatever.

00:12:32.310 --> 00:12:34.480
It's morning, Mujina.

00:12:39.450 --> 00:12:41.660
Shall we head back?

00:12:41.660 --> 00:12:43.330
Wanna see a movie?

00:12:43.330 --> 00:12:44.870
Whoa, shouldn't we--?

00:12:44.870 --> 00:12:45.820
Which movie?

00:12:45.820 --> 00:12:47.000
You're going?!

00:13:00.260 --> 00:13:02.640
Where is it?

00:13:02.640 --> 00:13:05.720
Whoa, whoa, whoa. You serious?

00:13:05.720 --> 00:13:07.680
That sounds awesome.

00:13:07.680 --> 00:13:08.600
Huh?

00:13:13.480 --> 00:13:15.940
What are you doing?

00:13:15.940 --> 00:13:17.530
Knight?

00:13:18.990 --> 00:13:22.070
That one <i>kaiju </i>got away.

00:13:22.070 --> 00:13:25.120
I should've dealt with it back then.

00:13:26.330 --> 00:13:28.370
I'll have to step in.

00:13:28.370 --> 00:13:32.790
Huh? Do you have a way to find <i>kaiju</i>?

00:13:32.790 --> 00:13:33.920
I do.

00:13:33.920 --> 00:13:36.300
Seriously? What a relief!

00:13:36.300 --> 00:13:39.920
Yomogi Asanaka, let's find the <i>kaiju</i>.

00:13:39.920 --> 00:13:44.470
Uh, sure... and thanks. But, how?

00:13:44.470 --> 00:13:46.350
Search till we find it.

00:13:48.430 --> 00:13:50.640
Search till we find it.

00:13:52.230 --> 00:13:53.230
Right.

00:13:55.060 --> 00:13:58.610
Whoa, holy shit! This is sick!

00:13:58.610 --> 00:13:59.940
Shut up!

00:14:01.530 --> 00:14:03.910
You taking a break, too?

00:14:03.910 --> 00:14:06.700
Yeah. No sign of the <i>kaiju</i>.

00:14:06.700 --> 00:14:08.990
Tell me about it.

00:14:08.990 --> 00:14:10.290
Watching a movie?

00:14:10.290 --> 00:14:12.710
My battery's gonna die.

00:14:15.290 --> 00:14:19.130
Do you think the <i>kaiju </i>has a heart?

00:14:19.130 --> 00:14:21.090
Why do you ask?

00:14:21.090 --> 00:14:27.220
Until now, I thought we had to kill <i>kaiju</i>
because they run amok.

00:14:27.220 --> 00:14:34.020
But if it's like you're saying--
that <i>kaiju </i>are born from human emotions,

00:14:34.020 --> 00:14:38.070
maybe there's <i>kaiju </i>with feelings like us.

00:14:38.070 --> 00:14:40.400
Some <i>kaiju </i>do have hearts.

00:14:40.400 --> 00:14:42.110
Then, what if this one--?

00:14:42.110 --> 00:14:44.490
Others will fool you.

00:14:44.490 --> 00:14:48.370
If you guess wrong
and people die, it's too late.

00:14:48.370 --> 00:14:51.910
Why do you know so much about <i>kaiju</i>?

00:14:51.910 --> 00:14:53.750
I just do.

00:14:57.710 --> 00:15:03.670
If <i>kaiju </i>are a threat, I'll kill
without hesitation as I always do.

00:15:06.680 --> 00:15:08.010
--Hello?
--Yomogi!

00:15:08.010 --> 00:15:10.010
I found the <i>kaiju</i>!

00:15:18.110 --> 00:15:19.190
Gauma!

00:15:19.190 --> 00:15:21.730
Let's try to stop it together!

00:15:21.730 --> 00:15:23.280
Right!

00:15:23.280 --> 00:15:26.360
Access Mode... Dyna Diver!

00:15:26.360 --> 00:15:28.320
Dyna Striker!

00:15:30.620 --> 00:15:34.580
Since I messed up this time,
I've gotta defeat it!

00:15:37.330 --> 00:15:40.210
It's dangerous to fire missiles here!

00:15:40.210 --> 00:15:41.460
Good point.

00:15:41.460 --> 00:15:45.920
I'll lure it outside the city
and you can hit it!

00:15:45.920 --> 00:15:49.340
It feels like you're growing up, kid.

00:15:49.340 --> 00:15:50.180
Hold up.

00:15:50.180 --> 00:15:51.140
What?

00:15:51.140 --> 00:15:53.640
I'm probably older than you.

00:15:53.640 --> 00:15:57.600
But I'm plus five thousand.
Five thousand years.

00:15:57.600 --> 00:15:59.690
Sh-Shut up.

00:16:00.940 --> 00:16:02.150
What's up?

00:16:02.150 --> 00:16:05.690
It's Sunday, so maybe it's an event.

00:16:05.690 --> 00:16:06.990
I see.

00:16:11.580 --> 00:16:13.120
A <i>kaiju</i>?

00:16:13.120 --> 00:16:16.040
Hey! This way, this way!

00:16:16.040 --> 00:16:17.830
This way, this way!

00:16:19.830 --> 00:16:22.000
Nice, it's working!

00:16:29.340 --> 00:16:35.020
Argh! The exit's gonna
be packed! Huh? Minami?

00:16:35.970 --> 00:16:37.010
Chise!

00:16:37.010 --> 00:16:39.230
Minami!

00:16:39.230 --> 00:16:45.320
Sorry! Sorry! Sorry! Sorry! Sorry!

00:16:45.320 --> 00:16:49.320
If it's that big, it's dangerous. Kill it.

00:16:49.320 --> 00:16:53.120
I guess the Eugenicists must've found it.

00:16:56.080 --> 00:16:57.540
Koyomi!

00:16:57.540 --> 00:16:58.620
Koyomi!

00:16:58.620 --> 00:17:02.170
It's doing damage. No time to hesitate.

00:17:03.210 --> 00:17:08.470
Yomogi Asanaka,
let's defeat the <i>kaiju </i>together.

00:17:08.470 --> 00:17:09.840
Together?

00:17:10.720 --> 00:17:12.800
Let me use you.

00:17:17.020 --> 00:17:19.940
Access Mode... Dyna Soldier!

00:17:26.230 --> 00:17:27.480
What's this?!

00:17:27.480 --> 00:17:30.740
It must have adapted to my presence.

00:17:30.740 --> 00:17:31.780
Adapted?

00:17:31.780 --> 00:17:33.530
Meaning, this!

00:17:34.910 --> 00:17:37.870
Dynamic Cannon!

00:17:49.420 --> 00:17:50.970
You're kidding!

00:17:55.010 --> 00:17:57.470
Take aim, Yomogi Asanaka.

00:17:58.600 --> 00:18:03.190
Should we really be killing it like this?

00:18:03.190 --> 00:18:07.900
What if <i>kaiju </i>have hearts and emotions?

00:18:07.900 --> 00:18:09.820
Yomo!

00:18:09.820 --> 00:18:13.160
Bad news! Minami's still in there!

00:18:13.160 --> 00:18:14.490
She is?!

00:18:14.490 --> 00:18:17.410
We got split up while leaving!

00:18:24.210 --> 00:18:25.290
Yomogi!

00:18:25.290 --> 00:18:26.880
Minami?!

00:18:26.880 --> 00:18:31.130
I'm still inside the building,
but my Dyna Wing--!

00:18:38.140 --> 00:18:40.390
Minami! Minami!

00:18:40.390 --> 00:18:42.020
Son of a--!

00:18:45.850 --> 00:18:49.690
What are you doing?
There's no time to hesitate.

00:18:53.360 --> 00:18:55.280
Please, work!

00:18:58.660 --> 00:19:01.250
Instance Domina--!

00:19:06.670 --> 00:19:09.630
Now! Do it, Yomogi Asanaka!

00:19:31.610 --> 00:19:34.990
Dynamic Fire!

00:20:00.640 --> 00:20:02.220
Yomogi...

00:20:10.480 --> 00:20:12.400
Over here, Minami!

00:20:13.320 --> 00:20:15.940
Sorry. I dropped Dyna Wing.

00:20:15.940 --> 00:20:17.700
Least it wasn't stolen.

00:20:17.700 --> 00:20:18.570
True.

00:20:18.570 --> 00:20:20.740
She's not you.

00:20:30.250 --> 00:20:35.010
Sorry. It's my fault this happened.

00:20:35.010 --> 00:20:39.050
No, it's because I said something weird.

00:20:39.050 --> 00:20:41.050
Yomogi...

00:20:41.050 --> 00:20:44.390
When I was about to shoot, the <i>kaiju</i>...

00:20:44.390 --> 00:20:46.100
It looked at me.

00:20:47.180 --> 00:20:50.440
Hope it was just my imagination.

00:20:52.230 --> 00:20:54.400
<i>Kaiju </i>are <i>kaiju</i>.

00:21:02.450 --> 00:21:03.870
Huh?

00:21:03.870 --> 00:21:05.540
That was amazing!

00:21:05.540 --> 00:21:08.660
Yeah, I thought I was dead!

00:21:09.670 --> 00:21:13.090
When the water spewed up
like that, it was incred--

00:21:20.880 --> 00:21:23.470
Are you feeling down?

00:21:23.470 --> 00:21:26.180
No, not really.

00:21:36.280 --> 00:21:37.400
What?

00:21:40.490 --> 00:21:41.950
Thanks.

00:21:41.950 --> 00:21:43.490
Huh?

00:21:43.490 --> 00:21:48.000
I heard you saved everyone from the <i>kaiju</i>.

00:21:49.330 --> 00:21:52.960
It was Knight more so than me, but...

00:21:57.050 --> 00:21:58.800
Are you hungry?

00:21:59.720 --> 00:22:01.050
Starving.

00:22:01.970 --> 00:22:04.550
Wanna go somewhere?

00:22:06.560 --> 00:22:08.140
Where?

00:22:09.850 --> 00:22:11.520
Anywhere is fine.

00:22:15.810 --> 00:22:16.860
Mmm.
